      <expected>Comments anchored to correct clauses; explanation text present; no console errors.</expected>
    </test>
  </ui-tests>

  <notes>
    Critical path (001→010→020→023→031→040). Anchoring reuse is the key to correctness — do not reinvent it.

    COMPLETED 2026-07-26. Event + receiver: `compose_advisory_comments` added as an additive
    WorkspacePaneEvent discriminant (PaneEventTypes.ts) carrying `advisoryComments[]` (targetText/
