    `placeAdvisoryComments()` on ComposeEditorHandle — reuses resolveTargetSpans('strict') +
    a dedicated useComposeCommentThreads(editor, 'AI Advisory Review') instance's createThread (no
    anchoring reimplementation); failed resolutions (not_found/ambiguous) are returned, never
    dropped. ComposeWorkspace wires the receiver to the handle + console.warns on failures (a
    user-visible surface awaits the review-summary panel, task 030). Emission: new hook
    `useNdaReviewAdvisoryCommentsBridge.ts` in SpaarkeAi's conversation folder, wired into
    ConversationPane's existing `dispatchComposeAction` informational-result branch (structural
    shape-detection on `{overallRisk, flaggedSections[]}`, mirroring composeResultFormat.ts's
    convention) — a client-derived projection of the SAME terminal chunk already rendered as prose;
    no second model call, no new server disposition. 15 new tests added (2 ComposeEditor-level,
    13 bridge-level) alongside the existing 532; all green. Full client build chain (ai-widgets →
